With the [config](https://gist.github.com/reporter/fac343718317ef531061180c0cd96824), I tested the ECH working status with curl and chromium, found that there may be some issue with the wildcard certificate working with ECH. Tested with 39262f86632401ae4915600b042ef5a28141d3d5

Here is part of the log, TLDR, all subdomains `*.nyaw.xyz` (that are using wildcard certificate) has ech status of `not configured` (even if the HTTPS record for `*`  existed):


```console
curl -v --ech true --doh-url https://1.1.1.1/dns-query https://matrix.nyaw.xyz

# snippet
* ECH: result: status is not configured, inner is NULL, outer is NULL
* ALPN: server accepted h2
* Server certificate:
*  subject: CN=*.nyaw.xyz
# snippet
```

```console
> curl -v --ech true --doh-url https://1.1.1.1/dns-query https://yidhra.nyaw.xyz
#...
* SSL connection using TLSv1.3 / TLS_AES_128_GCM_SHA256 / X25519MLKEM768 / id-ecPublicKey
* ECH: result: status is not configured, inner is NULL, outer is NULL
* ALPN: server accepted h2
* Server certificate:
*  subject: CN=*.nyaw.xyz
```

[dns.google query result](https://dns.google/query?name=matrix.nyaw.xyz&rr_type=HTTPS&ecs=) (no HTTPS record with ech pubkey exist, if it has, it's I'm in debugging)

![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63611a53-cfbb-4481-864f-54a8b9034af0)

The part of my config , `matrix.nyaw.xyz` placed in subroute of `*.nyaw.xyz`, and `yidhra.nyaw.xyz` is standalone. All of 3rd level domain has ECH status of not configured. And I set prefer_wildcard enabled.

```json5
{
  "apps": {
    "http": {
      "servers": {
        "srv0": {
          "automatic_https": {
            "prefer_wildcard": true,
            "skip_certificates": []
          },
          "routes": [
            {
              "handle": [
                {
                  "handler": "subroute",
                  "routes": [
                    {
                      // matrix.nyaw.xyz and all other domains here
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "match": [
                {
                  "host": ["*.nyaw.xyz"]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "handle": [
                // ..
              ],
              "match": [
                {
                  "host": ["yidhra.nyaw.xyz"],
                  "path": ["/metrics"]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "handle": [
                // ...
              ],
              "match": [
                {
                  "host": ["yidhra.nyaw.xyz"],
                  "path": ["/probe"]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "strict_sni_host": false
        }
      }
    }
    // ...
  }
}
```
**While I set** `prefer_wildcard` false, after reloading, following HTTPS record newly added to cloudflare, ECH status for `yidhra.nyaw.xyz` turns to success. (other *.nyaw.xyz remains)

![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0587ba9-6661-44ad-b68d-f4a1d3eb7e91)

