> curl -v --ech true --doh-url https://1.1.1.1/dns-query https://yidhra.nyaw.xyz
* Some HTTPS RR to process
* Host yidhra.nyaw.xyz:443 was resolved.
* IPv6: (none)
* IPv4: 8.210.47.13
*   Trying 8.210.47.13:443...
